BS_:

BU_: ESP32_RTC Node_A

BO_ 256 RTC_TIME_BCAST: 8 ESP32_RTC
 SG_ Year : 0|8@1+ (1,2000) [2000|2255] "year" Node_A
 SG_ Month : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [1|12] "" Node_A
 SG_ Day : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [1|31] "" Node_A
 SG_ Hour : 24|8@1+ (1,0) [0|23] "" Node_A
 SG_ Minute : 32|8@1+ (1,0) [0|59] "" Node_A
 SG_ Second : 40|8@1+ (1,0) [0|59] "" Node_A

BO_ 257 RTC_TIME_SET: 8 Node_A
 SG_ Year : 0|8@1+ (1,2000) [2000|2255] "year" ESP32_RTC
 SG_ Month : 8|8@1+ (1,0) [1|12] "" ESP32_RTC
 SG_ Day : 16|8@1+ (1,0) [1|31] "" ESP32_RTC
 SG_ Hour : 24|8@1+ (1,0) [0|23] "" ESP32_RTC
 SG_ Minute : 32|8@1+ (1,0) [0|59] "" ESP32_RTC
 SG_ Second : 40|8@1+ (1,0) [0|59] "" ESP32_RTC

CM_ BO_ 256 "Broadcast of current RTC time, sent every 1000ms by the ESP32.";
CM_ BO_ 257 "Command sent to the ESP32 to set the RTC time.";
CM_ SG_ 256 Year "Offset from year 2000 (raw 0-255 maps to 2000-2255)";
CM_ SG_ 257 Year "Offset from year 2000 (raw 0-255 maps to 2000-2255)";
